# Node-local runtime state — never commit.
rooms/
iroh_node_id.key
# 🏦 The SSF wallet's 24-word identity (chia_wallet.rs), and a raw seed
# from before the words with its archives: each one is a wallet's secret.
chia_identity.json
chia_identity.seed
chia_identity.seed.retired-*
wallet_lease.json
# 🏦 The SSF wallet switch the Bank remembers, and the player's "I saved the
# 24 words" (chia_wallet_switch.rs)
chia_wallet.json
chia_words_saved.json
# Private temporary files (`.<name>.<pid>-<seq>.tmp`, chia_wallet.rs and
# chia_contact.rs): a node stopped mid-write can leave one holding a secret.
.*.tmp
target/
blob-cache/
torrent-cache/
